es started radiating with a strong, yet gentle glow that quietly absorbed the souls' cries. As Lucy took the first steps of her graceful dance, the wandering souls —after drifting through the mortal realm for so long— were finally able to depart to a place of eternal rest without any lingering regrets."},"used_in":[{"tip":"Raid: Iron Devourer","cat":"pve","banner":"RAID_ID.webp"},{"tip":"Adventure (Both)","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENTURE_BOTH.webp"},{"tip":"Advent Expedition: Yeonhee","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENT_YH.webp"},{"tip":"Power Up Dungeon","cat":"pve","banner":"PU_DUNGEON.webp"},{"tip":"Infinite Tower","cat":"pve","banner":"INFINITE_TOWER.webp"},{"tip":"Tower of Trials","cat":"pve","banner":"TOWER_OF_TRIALS.webp"}],"lore":"Lucy is a dancer who travels with the bard Yui.\nHer easygoing, carefree attitude lets her stay positive even in dire situations, a skill her partner Yui tries to emulate.\nShe's a skilled dancer and is also spiritually attuned — specifically, she is a medium that can talk to the souls of the dead.\nWhen she was passing through Dark Grave, she thought she heard voices calling out to her.\nShe chalked it up to her imagination at first, but the words grew louder and clearer. The souls of the dead were trying to talk to her, and she discovered that she was able to hear them.\nAfter this revelation, she wholeheartedly embraced the ability — she travels the world to meet various lost and cursed souls and helps them find peace."}